  "title": "GrubMarket Appoints Jorge deNeve as Chief Legal Officer",
  "summary": "We are pleased to announce the appointment of Jorge deNeve as Chief Legal Officer, further strengthening GrubMarket’s executive team as we continue to scale our technology, AI, and food supply chain businesses. Jorge brings more than two decades of experience in corporate governance, regulatory compliance, and securities law from his experience as an enforcement attorney […]",
